CodeSystem: TrustDemoDataElements
Id: TrustDemoDataElements
Title: "Data elements of the journeys"
Description: "Every data element of the data dictionary, by its code (TD.<data set>.DE<nn>)."
* ^experimental = true
* ^caseSensitive = true
* #TD.J1.DE01 "Name" "The child's name as the birth hospital records it."
* #TD.J1.DE02 "Date of birth" "The child's date of birth."
* #TD.J1.DE03 "Parent or guardian name" "The parent or guardian, for a subject with no identity document such as a newborn (STT-PAY-005)."
* #TD.J1.DE04 "Hospital number" "The birth hospital's own identifier for the child. It is not carried in the DVC."
* #TD.J1.DE05 "Vaccine product" "The product given, in the issuer's product coding (illustrative PreQual-style codes)."
* #TD.J1.DE06 "Date of vaccination" "The date the dose was given. The hospital record holds the time as well; the DVC carries the date."
* #TD.J1.DE07 "Batch number" "The batch (lot) of the vaccine given."
* #TD.J1.DE08 "Dose number" "The dose's number in its series. Recorded by the hospital; the minimal DVC payload does not carry it."
* #TD.J1.DE09 "Supervising clinician" "The clinician who gave or supervised the dose."
* #TD.J1.DE10 "Issuing country" "The trust-network participant whose key signs the DVC (J1: XXR)."
* #TD.J1.DE11 "Issued at" "When the DVC was signed."
* #TD.J1.DE12 "Expires at" "When the DVC stops verifying, where the issuer sets an expiry."
* #TD.J1.DE13 "Key identifier (kid)" "Identifies the document signer certificate on the trust list that verifies the DVC (J1: 916ffa567c0f44a2)."
* #TD.J2A.DE01 "Household id" "The household on the CHW's roster that the child joins."
* #TD.J2A.DE02 "Child's given name" "The child's given name."
* #TD.J2A.DE03 "Child's family name" "The child's family name."
* #TD.J2A.DE04 "Date of birth" "The child's date of birth."
* #TD.J2A.DE05 "Country of birth" "The country the child was born in, when abroad."
* #TD.J2A.DE06 "Foreign vaccination cards held" "Whether the family holds vaccination cards from abroad."
* #TD.J2A.DE07 "Temporary id" "The id the child carries until civil registration catches up."
* #TD.J2A.DE08 "Registered by" "The community health worker who registered the child."
* #TD.J2A.DE09 "Registered at" "When the registration was captured, on the phone, possibly offline."
* #TD.J2A.DE10 "Informant" "The family member who gave the answers."
* #TD.J2A.DE11 "Dose read from a foreign card" "One dose read from a foreign DVC with the unverified triage read (STT-VER-011), saved as reported by the family."
* #TD.J2A.DE12 "Vaccine product (as read)" "The issuer's product code as read from the card; no national code is added yet."
* #TD.J2A.DE13 "Date of vaccination (as read)" "The date of vaccination as read from the card."
* #TD.J2A.DE14 "Batch number (as read)" "The batch number as read from the card."
* #TD.J2A.DE15 "Reported by" "The family member who showed the card: the dose's information source."
* #TD.J2A.DE16 "Record outcome" "Always reported-unverified for a triage read (decision table TD.DT.01); recorded as primarySource false with a note."
* #TD.J2B.DE01 "Child" "The child referred."
* #TD.J2B.DE02 "Referred by" "The community health worker who made the referral."
* #TD.J2B.DE03 "Referred to" "The clinic that will verify the cards."
* #TD.J2B.DE04 "Referred at" "When the referral was made."
* #TD.J2B.DE05 "Reason" "Why the child is referred: unverified foreign vaccination cards."
* #TD.J2B.DE06 "Doses to verify" "The reported doses the clinic is asked to verify."
* #TD.J2B.DE07 "Referral status" "Active until the clinic records an outcome for every dose it lists, then completed (indicator TD.IND.03)."
* #TD.J3A.DE01 "Key identifier (kid)" "The kid of the DVC verified, which names the signer's certificate."
* #TD.J3A.DE02 "Issuing country" "The participant that signed the DVC (CWT iss)."
* #TD.J3A.DE03 "Verified at" "When the verification ran."
* #TD.J3A.DE04 "Verifier" "The system that verified the DVC."
* #TD.J3A.DE05 "Verification result" "The library's typed result (STT-VER-008)."
* #TD.J3A.DE06 "Failed step" "The step at which verification stopped, when it failed."
* #TD.J3A.DE07 "Failure reason" "Why verification stopped, when it failed: the input of decision table TD.DT.01."
* #TD.J3A.DE08 "Trust list refreshed at" "When the verifier last refreshed its cached copy of the trust list; a signer added since then fails with KidNotFound (STT-VER-006)."
* #TD.J3A.DE09 "Record outcome" "What the DVC becomes in the record (decision table TD.DT.01)."
* #TD.J3A.DE10 "Imported dose" "The dose recorded from the verified DVC."
* #TD.J3A.DE11 "Reported dose replaced" "The reported dose the verified one replaces."
* #TD.J3A.DE12 "Trust policy" "The trust framework the DVC was verified under."
* #TD.J3B.DE01 "Issuer's product code" "The vaccine code as the issuer signed it; kept, never replaced (STD-SEM-001)."
* #TD.J3B.DE02 "National schedule code" "The national schedule's antigen-and-dose code, added beside the product code. Absent for an unmapped dose, which the TrustDemoLaoImmunization profile (laoEpi 1..1) does not yet represent."
* #TD.J3B.DE03 "Mapping basis" "How the schedule code was found (decision table TD.DT.02)."
* #TD.J3B.DE04 "Confirmed by" "The clinician who confirmed an equivalent the map did not cover."
* #TD.J3B.DE05 "Counts toward the schedule" "Whether the schedule counts the dose (decision table TD.DT.03): only doses from a primary source with a national schedule code."
* #TD.J3B.DE06 "Dose due" "A dose of the national schedule the evaluation finds due (decision table TD.DT.04)."
* #TD.J3B.DE07 "Schedule dose" "The schedule's antigen-and-dose code of the dose due."
* #TD.J3B.DE08 "Forecast status" "The forecast for the dose."
* #TD.J3B.DE09 "Due date" "The child's date of birth plus the schedule action's timing age."
* #TD.J3B.DE10 "Reminder" "The reminder created for the next visit."
* #TD.J40.DE01 "Subject" "The family member whose summary is shared."
* #TD.J40.DE02 "Holder" "The person who shares the link and decides who may open it."
* #TD.J40.DE03 "Custodian" "The home-country service that hosts the record and checks every request."
* #TD.J40.DE04 "Shared document" "The patient summary the link releases."
* #TD.J40.DE05 "Valid from" "The first day the link may be opened."
* #TD.J40.DE06 "Valid until" "The expiry the holder chose; after it the link releases nothing (STD-ACC-001)."
* #TD.J40.DE07 "Purpose" "The purpose of use the holder allows (J4: treatment)."
* #TD.J40.DE08 "Passcode set" "Whether the holder protected the link with a passcode. The passcode itself is never stored in the record."
* #TD.J40.DE09 "Withdrawn at" "When the holder withdrew the link, if they did."
* #TD.J41.DE01 "Requested at" "When the request arrived."
* #TD.J41.DE02 "Requester" "The receiving system abroad that asked for the manifest."
* #TD.J41.DE03 "Requester network address" "Where the request came from."
* #TD.J41.DE04 "Custodian" "The home-country gateway that answered and logged the request."
* #TD.J41.DE05 "Patient" "Whose record was asked for."
* #TD.J41.DE06 "Released" "Whether the manifest was released (decision table TD.DT.05)."
* #TD.J41.DE07 "Audit outcome" "0 when released; 4 (minor failure) when refused."
* #TD.J41.DE08 "Refusal reason" "Why nothing was released, when refused."
* #TD.J41.DE09 "Consent" "The holder's consent the request was checked against."
* #TD.J41.DE10 "Document released" "The summary released, when released."

CodeSystem: TrustDemoVerificationResult
Id: TrustDemoVerificationResult
Title: "Result of reading a DVC"
Description: "What the HCERT library returns for one scanned DVC: a verified result, a failed result naming the step and reason (STT-VER-008), or the distinct result of the unverified triage read (STT-VER-011)."
* ^experimental = true
* ^caseSensitive = true
* #verified "Verified" "Every step of verification passed (STT-VER-001)."
* #failed "Failed" "Verification stopped at a step, for a reason from the closed set of STT-VER-008."
* #unverified "Read, not verified" "The payload was read by read-unverified, with no trust lookup or signature check (STT-VER-011)."

