Title: "What a scanned DVC becomes in the record"
Description: "The outcome of decision table TD.DT.01 for one scanned DVC."
* ^experimental = true
* ^caseSensitive = true
* #verified "Verified" "Recorded from its primary source, with provenance of the verification."
* #reported-unverified "Reported, not verified" "Kept as reported by the family (primarySource false); not counted by the schedule."
* #rejected "Rejected" "The certificate is not evidence of a dose; the step and reason are recorded."
* #not-read "Not read" "Nothing could be read from the QR; the card is treated as paper."

