Title: "How an imported dose got its national schedule code"
Description: "The outcome of decision table TD.DT.02 (STD-SEM-001)."
* ^experimental = true
* ^caseSensitive = true
* #concept-map "By the national ConceptMap" "The issuer's product code has an equivalent schedule code in the national map."
* #clinician-confirmed "Confirmed by the clinician" "The map had no entry; the clinician confirmed the equivalent, and the decision is added to the map."
* #unmapped "Unmapped" "No equivalent is known; the issuer's code is kept as it is and shown as unmapped."
* #not-imported "Not imported" "The dose was not verified, so it was not imported and not mapped."

